{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id34126931"}, "name":{"label":"Wazzupguy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-05-28T14:05:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"7399651930"}, "title":{"label":"Funny weather app with many features locked behind paywall"}, "content":{"label":"I love this weather app. I love that they have recently made it free to use, rather than buying the app, because it’s given me the chance to test it out. I don’t like however the monthly subscription needed to use many of the features. I would prefer the outright purchase option to still be available.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id36973293"}, "name":{"label":"Tige2021"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-05-28T08:19:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"7398675157"}, "title":{"label":"Great but redesign has massive oversight"}, "content":{"label":"This app does so many great things and it does them all with a sense of humour and style. BUT, one simple thing - despite all the customisation options - is stopping me from subscribing as I used to: there is now no way to click the day and see a graphical representation of the weather, as you can for today. Such a basic thing yet Carrot - with all its customisation - simply can not do it. If you click a future day, in any of the complex customisation templates available, you always get the same thing: an over-complex popup with piles of data, instead of the beautiful graphical representation we want (and the old version used to provide). When the designers correct this simple omission I’ll subscribe again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
