{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id118584703"}, "name":{"label":"thomashaywvrd"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-05-13T01:19:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2"}, "id":{"label":"7332707130"}, "title":{"label":"INCREDIBLE"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using this for years. I love the design and fun aspect of it. However, I am surprised at the accuracy compared to other apps. I am consistently right even when other apps all predict something else, rain predictions seem to be spot on to the hour. It’s quite fun telling your family that it won’t actually rain today despite what the iPhone weather app and BBC weather say! I’ve travelled round the world for 6 months with it and it was always quite accurate in USA, South East Asia, Australia, New Zealand and Europe! Worth the purchase, I couldn’t go back to another app. \n\n* 2021: The new updates are class and make it so customisable. I’ve just tipped the company because I love this app so much", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
