{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id824912632"}, "name":{"label":"Robtown58"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-05-12T07:40:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2"}, "id":{"label":"7329841811"}, "title":{"label":"Widgets don’t update"}, "content":{"label":"As the title says, my main widget I use for this doesn’t update. Absolutely p*ssing down outside and widget says it’s sunny. Freezing cold and says it’s 15 degrees 🤷🏻‍♂️ have to click the widget to open the app which then updates the widget. \n\nNot sure if this is an iOS issue or an app thing. Either way, I love this app but feel I’ve paid for something that doesn’t work how it should. \n\nShame 😔", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
