{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id4174052"}, "name":{"label":"Echelonfornix"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-03-18T00:51:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.1"}, "id":{"label":"7115817639"}, "title":{"label":"The app gets full stars"}, "content":{"label":"Unfortunately the services are dreadful in the uk.\n\nClimacell, sounds great but sadly doesn’t work here because nobody fixes the equipment that the data comes from.\n\nMeteogroup used to be great but that service has deteriorated.\n\nDark sky, short term is great but forecast is poor.\n\nBut the app is flawless! This frustrates the hell out of me.  Great app really great!  Poor data source for the Uk. \n\nWe use different forecast models to the USA which has incredible models which you can see with carrot.\n\nSo if your (NOT) in the uk and your wanting accurate weather forecast use this. Otherwise stick with default on device weather for accuracy.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
